Alignment [SimTalk] - Variable
Sets the Alignment of the Variable designated by the reference operator <&> with its insertion point.
Type
Attribute
Syntax
<&>Variable.Alignment:string
Assignment Value
You can assign a value of data type string.
You can specify "Left", "Name", "Value", or "Right".
Example
&MyVariable.Alignment := "Right"
See also
Alignment [Variable]
Alignment [SimTalk] - Variable
11-3806 Plant Simulation Help
