BackgroundColor [SimTalk] - Variable
Sets the Background Color of the Variable designated by the reference operator <&> in the Frame.
Type
Attribute
Syntax
<&>Variable.BackgroundColor:integer
Assignment Value
You can assign a value of data type integer.
Set the RGB values of the color with the method makeRGBValue.
Example
&MyVariable.BackgroundColor := makeRGBValue(100,100,100)
&MyVariable.BackgroundColor := 6579300 // is the same as the color above
