Name [SimTalk] - Variable
Sets the Name of the Variable designated by the reference operator <&>.
Remarks
You can type in a combination of letters, digits, and underscore (_) characters, for example MyVariable,
MyVariable1, My_Variable_1.
The name of an object cannot start with a digit, i.e., you cannot enter 1Variable.
Type
Attribute
Syntax
<&>Variable.Name:string
Assignment Value
You can assign a value of data type string.
Example
&Variable.Name := "MyVariable"
See also
Name [text box] - Variable
